# Input
```vue
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<template>
  <other-component>
    <span slot="header">Title</span>
  </other-component>
  <my-web-component>
    <div>
      <span slot="header">Not a direct child</span>
    </div>
  </my-web-component>
</template>

```

